  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Prime beef brisket becomes a melt-in-your-mouth masterpiece when slow-roasted with herbs, spices, and rich beef broth. The paprika-kissed crust gives way to tender meat that falls apart easily, while apple cider vinegar and honey add a sweet-tangy touch. Garlic, onion, and a hint of citrus zest enhance the flavors, making this brisket a cozy centerpiece for any gathering, full of warmth and deliciousness in every bite.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-prime-beef-brisket\">Why You’ll Love This prime beef brisket</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-prime-beef-brisket\">How to Make Prime Beef Brisket</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-prime-beef-brisket\">Pro Tips for Making prime beef brisket</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-prime-beef-brisket\">How to Serve this prime beef brisket</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-prime-beef-brisket\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This prime beef brisket</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It’s incredibly tender and juicy, melting in your mouth with every bite.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The slow-roasting method brings out rich flavors that will impress your family and friends.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfect for gatherings, this dish is a crowd-pleaser that everyone will rave about.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Simple ingredients make it easy to prepare, so you can focus on enjoying the moment.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Leftovers are a bonus, perfect for sandwiches or hearty soups the next day!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-9738\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"9738\" data-servings=\"8\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-padding-40 meadow-header\">\n  <div class=\"wprm-layout-column-container wprm-column-gap-20 wprm-column-rows-recipe-600 wprm-column-rows-reverse wprm-row-gap-20 meadow-header-columns\">\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-align-center\">\n      <div class=\"wprm-recipe-image wprm-block-image-rounded\"><img decoding=\"async\" style=\"border-width: 0px;border-style: solid;border-color: #666666;border-radius: 20px;width: 300px;max-width: 100%;height: 300px;object-fit: cover;\" width=\"533\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Deliciously-Smoked-Prime-Beef-Brisket.webp\" class=\"attachment-999999x300 size-999999x300\" alt=\"Sliced prime beef brisket on a wooden cutting board with herbs and barbecue sauce.\" srcset=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Deliciously-Smoked-Prime-Beef-Brisket.webp 1200w, https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Deliciously-Smoked-Prime-Beef-Brisket-300x169.webp 300w, https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Deliciously-Smoked-Prime-Beef-Brisket-1024x576.webp 1024w, https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Deliciously-Smoked-Prime-Beef-Brisket-768x432.webp 768w, https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Deliciously-Smoked-Prime-Beef-Brisket-480x270.webp 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 533px) 100vw, 533px\" /></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-column-width-75 wprm-align-rows-center\">\n      <div class=\"wprm-layout-container meadow-header-accent\" style=\"--wprm-layout-container-text-color: var(--meadow-accent-color);\">\n        \n      </div>\n      <h2 class=\"wprm-recipe-name wprm-block-text-bold\">prime beef brisket</h2>\n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"he